    "text": "By Helsinki, Finland ,\n9 hours ago A Stage Like No Other – Southern African Lifting Awards 2026. We are excited to announce that entries for the 2026 Southern African Lifting Awards are now officially open!. This annual celebration recognises excellence, innovation, safety, and leadership across the lifting industry. It provides a powerful platform to honour the individuals, teams, and companies who continue to raise the bar and shape the future of the sector. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
